  "notes": "Landing pages are stable; phone numbers, email aliases, room numbers, and office hours were verified 2026-08-31 and need annual re-verification. Routing quirks recorded in the resource: /cwc/ redirects to the Health and Wellness Services hub and the Campus Police emergency page labels two links pointing there as 'Counseling and Wellness Services' and 'Crisis Intervention and Victim Advocate'; /life-at-new/safety-conduct/title-ix/ redirects to the Title IX department page; Student Accounts and Parking Services share the START Center phone and room; the academic learning compacts page resolves at two paths. Office email aliases were recovered by decoding Cloudflare email obfuscation on the published pages; prefer aliases over individual addresses."
}
